A posting violates the supported commodity and cost annotation rules.

========== API ==========

totalHistory({ valuation: 'cost', dateBasis: 'transaction' })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening

2024-01-01 Invalid price on reporting currency
  Assets:Cash  100 SEK {2 SEK}
  Equity:Opening  -200 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "date": "2024-01-01",
    "amount": "-100",
    "commodity": "SEK"
  }
]

========== WARNINGS ==========

[INVALID_COMMODITY_TRADE] Lot cost expressed in the posting commodity SEK must value one SEK at exactly one SEK
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:8:3
